{
  "key": 33855,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon learn new techniques as\n",
        "they grow.\r",
        "But some moves must be taught to\n",
        "them by people."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused",
      "en_US": [
        "A Pokémon becomes easier to \n",
        "catch if it has a status problem.\r",
        "Sleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\n",
        "Those are all effective.\r",
        "But catching Pokémon is never\n",
        "a sure thing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_TrainingHouse_Text_ClaireIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Training a new team? I’d be\n",
        "delighted to help.\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_TrainingHouse_Text_After",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time you want\n",
        "to battle again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_TrainingHouse_Text_BernardIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "No tricks, no immunities. Just\n",
        "an honest battle.\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_TrainingHouse_Text_Declined",
      "en_US": "Whenever you’re ready, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0466_T03R0601_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
